^{:go/end 536} (go/method reconstructBlock "reconstructBlock dequantizes, performs the inverse DCT and stores the block\nto the image.\n" ^error [^{:tag (* decoder)} d ^{:tag (* block)} b ^int bx ^int by ^int compIndex]
